<title>JAPAN: Saudi cuts April Extra Light crude to Asia - traders.</title>
<headline>Saudi cuts April Extra Light crude to Asia - traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia has said it will cut its April-lifting price formula for Berri Extra Light crude to Asian customers by 25 cents a barrel, but will keep formulas for other crudes unchanged, traders said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
